<title>USA: Dean Witter Q1 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Dean Witter Q1 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.81		    $0.71</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 0.81		     0.70</p>
<p> Net			276,300		  245,800</p>
<p> Revs		   2,443,700		2,166,200</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     339,370		  348,280</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     339,380		  349,628</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name is Dean Witter, Discover &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 net operating revenues $1.65 billion vs $1.55 billion for 1996.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 net credit services income $146.2 million vs $124.3 million for 1996.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 net securities income $130.1 million vs 121.5 million for 1996.</p>
<p>First Call estimate for Q1 1997 was $0.81/share.</p>
</text>
